none.description:
{Fear My Roar}

Shrieks a terrifying scream that echoes in the mind of the target enemy unit.

The affected unit has a 20% chance to skip its turn.

basic.description:
{Basic Fear My Roar}

Shrieks a terrifying scream that echoes in the mind of the target enemy unit.

The affected unit has a 20% chance to skip its turn.

advanced.description:
{Advanced Fear My Roar}

Shrieks a terrifying scream that echoes in the mind of the target enemy unit and any enemy units adjacent to the target.

The affected units have a 25% chance to skip their turns.

expert.description:
{Expert Fear My Roar}

Shrieks a terrifying scream that echoes in the mind of the target enemy unit and any enemy units within 2 hexes of the target.

The affected units have a 30% chance to skip their turns.
